{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FIGHT-QUEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>In a colorful and horrific world, take control of a wandering &quot;Hero&quot; who attracts the interest of a powerful and mysterious fairy. Overcome all odds with your fists, and ask questions later.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A first-person rougelite\u00a0with satisfying brutality -\u00a0 Stack game-changing enchantments to become unstoppable, discover secrets in lovingly crafted arenas, and extract to a stronghold to overflow it's bank with gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/05757b08c8687ff14c62deb03d817935.poster.avif?t=1773699437\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/05757b08c8687ff14c62deb03d817935.webm?t=1773699437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gameplay inspired by first-person Soulslike movement and combat<i>,</i>\u00a0combined with roguelite upgrades and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/d22eb92e90d1cd1c2768035d0b35a384.poster.avif?t=1773699437\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/d22eb92e90d1cd1c2768035d0b35a384.webm?t=1773699437\" type=\